            "review_title": "Review at SH Garden",
            "review_text": "Maria C\nMelbourne, Australia77 contributions\n0\nSTOP LOOKING - GO\nSep 2026 • Couples\nWhat a find! It was kindly recommended by a local, and it didn’t disappoint. \nThe food was terrific, in fact the best we’ve had in Ho Chi Minh, their signature dishes being amazing. \nWe had the pancake (famous in the region), beef betel leaf & spring rolls.\nThey were so fresh & delicious.\nWe loved it so much we booked it again during our stay, just to try more on the menu. \nService was great, friendly and efficient, would not hesitate to recommend.\nRead more\nWritten September 6, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
