            "review_title": "Review at SH Garden",
            "review_text": "Lady W\n110 contributions\n0\nReturn to this restaurant\nJul 2026 • Friends\nWe came back to this restaurant after two years. The staff were still friendly and helpful, and the restaurant's interior remained comfortable and inviting.\n\nCompared to our previous visit, however, the food was only average. The salted baked lemongrass chicken was a bit disappointing—the chicken was slightly tough and lacked the fragrant lemongrass flavor we expected. The pork was also tough instead of being crispy and crunchy.\n\nThe only dish we really enjoyed was the spring rolls, which were served in three different styles. They were creative, delicious, and the highlight of our meal.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 5, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
